  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Prepositions with a dative",
   "texto": [
    "Some prepositions always ask for **dativo**: **mit** (with), **von** (of), **aus** (of, from), **nach** (after) and **zu** (a).",
    "With the article: **der** and **das** pass to **dem**; **die** passes to **der**; and the plural **die** passes to **den**. Examples: **mit dem Tee** (with tea), **mit der Tablette** (with pill), **mit den Tabletten** (with pills)."
   ]
